### NexusMarket - pruebas manuales con la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (humao.rest-client)
### Haz clic en "Send Request" sobre cada bloque. Usuarios semilla: contraseña Password123*

@host = http://localhost:8080
@password = Password123*

### 1. Catálogo público (sin token)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/products

### 2. Login comprador
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "buyer.laura", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@buyerToken = {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

### 3. Agregar al carrito (2 laptops)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/buyer/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "LAPTOP-14-8GB", "quantity": 2 }

### 4. Ver carrito
GET {{host}}/api/v1/buyer/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 5. Checkout (reserva inventario -> PENDING_PAYMENT). La dirección debe ser la principal o una adicional.
# @name checkout
POST {{host}}/api/v1/buyer/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingAddress": "Carrera 70 #44-12 Medellin" }

###
@orderId = {{checkout.response.body.orderId}}

### 6. Pagar (-> PAID, salida por venta, factura)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/buyer/orders/{{orderId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD" }

### 7. Facturas del comprador
GET {{host}}/api/v1/buyer/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 8. Login operador logístico
# @name loginOperator
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "operator.nexus", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@operatorToken = {{loginOperator.response.body.token}}

### 9. Pedidos listos para despachar
GET {{host}}/api/v1/logistics/orders/ready-to-ship
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### 10. Despachar (-> SHIPPED)
# @name dispatch
POST {{host}}/api/v1/logistics/orders/{{orderId}}/shipment
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "carrier": "Servientrega", "trackingNumber": "SRV-0001" }

###
@shipmentId = {{dispatch.response.body.shipmentId}}

### 11. Confirmar entrega (-> DELIVERED, pedido finalizado)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/logistics/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### 12. Solicitar devolución (comprador)
# @name returnRequest
POST {{host}}/api/v1/buyer/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}", "sku": "LAPTOP-14-8GB", "quantity": 1, "reason": "DEFECTIVE", "comment": "No enciende" }

###
@returnId = {{returnRequest.response.body.returnId}}

### 13. Login administrador
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin.nexus", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 14. Aprobar devolución (admin)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/admin/returns/{{returnId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "APPROVED" }

### 15. Recibir devolución en bodega (operador) -> queda como inventario dañado (DEFECTIVE)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/logistics/returns/{{returnId}}/reception
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### 16. Emitir reembolso (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/returns/{{returnId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. Registrar vendedor + primera bodega (solo admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/sellers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identification": "900333444", "name": "Moda Caribe S.A.S.", "email": "ventas@modacaribe.com",
  "phoneNumber": "6053330000", "address": "Calle 84 #50-20 Barranquilla", "storeName": "Moda Caribe",
  "username": "seller.modacaribe", "password": "Password123*",
  "firstWarehouse": { "code": "WH-MOD-01", "name": "Bodega Moda Caribe", "city": "Barranquilla", "address": "Via 40 #70-10" }
}

### 18. Login vendedor
# @name loginSeller
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "seller.tecnoandes", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@sellerToken = {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}

### 19. Crear producto (vendedor)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/seller/products
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse inalambrico", "description": "Mouse ergonomico", "category": "ELECTRONICS", "productType": "PHYSICAL",
  "variants": [ { "sku": "MOUSE-BLK", "description": "Negro", "price": 85000, "currency": "COP" } ]
}

### 20. Ingreso de inventario en su propia bodega (vendedor)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/seller/inventory/inflows
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouseId": "WH-TEC-01", "sku": "MOUSE-BLK", "quantity": 20 }

### 21. Supervisor: reporte administrativo (solo consulta)
# @name loginSupervisor
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "supervisor.nexus", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/supervisor/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.token}}

### 22. Bitácora (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 23. Logout (invalida el token)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
